+
+This article lists the permissions for the Azure resource providers in the Compute category. You can use these permissions in your own Azure custom roles to provide granular access control to resources in Azure. Permission strings have the following format: `{Company}.{ProviderName}/{resourceType}/{action}`
+
+## microsoft.app
+
+Azure service: Azure Container Apps
