+# Task 5 Azure contracts
+
+Investigation selection, 2026-10-06 UTC / 2026-10-05 Eastern. Category: **Verified documentation** for referenced provider fields; **Proposed application policy** where explicitly marked. No resource definitions, Azure calls, permission assignments, job starts or trigger activation were performed. Owner accepted revision3 D-01–D-04 binding/names/actors/operator selection in `owner-decision-response-r3-part1.json`; D-05–D-08, D-14 and D-18 remain pending. All effective behavior below is **reserved/not_run** for Stage7.
+
+## Selected resource and operation versions
+
+Management `api-version` and Storage data-plane `x-ms-version` are independent. Short path `RG` below is `/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers`; all ARM operations use `https://management.azure.com/` and its token audience. Resource names/IDs in paths remain proposed, not deployed. Retained current extracts are `provider/task5-contracts/*.web-extract.txt`; claim-specific retrieval records identify URLs, retention times and hashes. Template references establish resource field schemas, not observed HTTP response bodies. Schema validation/build and every actual PUT/GET response stay Stage 7.
