+L32: ##
+L33: 
+L34: Start a Container Apps Job
+L35: 
+L36:     `POST https://management.azure.com/subscriptions/{subscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{resourceGroupName}/providers/Microsoft.App/jobs/{jobName}/start?api-version=2026-07-01`
+L37: ## URI Parameters
