+L39: Name  | In  | Required  | Type  | Description
+L40: --- | --- | --- | --- | ---
+L41: jobName  | path  | True  | string pattern: ^[-\w\._\(\)]+$  | Job Name
+L42: resourceGroupName  | path  | True  | string minLength: 1
+L43: maxLength: 90  | The name of the resource group. The name is case insensitive.
+L44: subscriptionId  | path  | True  | string (uuid)  | The ID of the target subscription. The value must be an UUID.
+L45: api-version  | query  | True  | string minLength: 1  | The API version to use for this operation.
+L46: ## Request Body
