+L48: Name  | Type  | Description
+L49: --- | --- | ---
+L50: containers  | cite6†JobExecutionContainer []  | List of container definitions for the Container Apps Job.
+L51: initContainers  | cite6†JobExecutionContainer []  | List of specialized containers that run before job containers.
